stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> delivered
  delivered --> upserted: vLLM and OpenSearch ok
  delivered --> transient: timeout, 5xx, conflict
  transient --> delivered: in-process backoff, attempt under 5
  transient --> poison: attempt reaches 5
  poison --> dlq: produce to vvs.embed.dlq or vvs.caption.dlq
  upserted --> committed: commit offset
  dlq --> committed: commit offset so the partition unblocks
  committed --> [*]
